usage: aiopsctl plugin check [<dir>] [--write] [--json] [--against <dist.yaml>]

Run the eight steps of the plugin check on a plugin directory.

Flags:
  --write                write the generated half of plugin.yaml and the generated tests
  --json                 print the report as JSON
  --against <dist.yaml>  the published signed manifest of the release to check against

Exit codes:
  0  success, or help that was asked for
  1  a denial, a failed step, rebuild-required, an interrupt or a failed boot; the reason is on stderr
  2  a usage error; a Go panic outside every fiber also exits 2, with the trace of the runtime
